   "id": "flashback-2-146699@major-2024-06-27",
   "gameId": "flashback-2-146699",
   "displayName": "🛠️ Major update now available 🔫",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-06-27T13:27:16.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello dear players,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The major update is now available",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Following the update, we recommend starting a new game to fully enjoy the gameplay improvements and avoid any potential conflict with your previous game save.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Gameplay improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Possibility to lock onto enemies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved melee combat",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New laser aiming ability",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Manuel reloading replaced by an overheat system",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New button dedicated to activating the Supernova",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Controls improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Better control of crouch and run, easier menu navigation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "After a GAME OVER, the player will now return to the latest save (the previous respawn system is still an option)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "More intense battles: difficulty adjustments and improvements to boss fights",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New and improved sound and visual effects",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Performance optimization",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New text languages available: Polish, Czech, Russian, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Arabic",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "General updates",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "After a GAME OVER, the player is now spawned at the last savepoint instead of instantly respawning in the battle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New and better located savepoints",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved aiming: New option to add a laser aim. Aim-assist sensitivity has been adjusted",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Controls adjustment - Key points:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Manual reloading replaced by an overheat system",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Addition of a manual enemy lock-on button",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The supernova can now be stored and triggered with a dedicated button",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sprint can be activated with a simple press of the Sprint button",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Crouch is now activated with {} while Conrad is not moving",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The directional buttons can now be used in menus and inventory",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Molecular Analyzer is now automatically triggered when necessary",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Melee attack improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Overall difficulty balancing - Key points:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fine-tuning of fight difficulty in certain parts of the game. Implementation of a 3-medkits limit. Users cannot save up infinite medkits",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Boss battle improvements (patterns, visual effects)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cameras and HUD revamp in the final zone",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Significant improvements to in-game HUD and menus",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tutorials update: explanations of new game mechanics, better organization of existing helps, clearer guides",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improvements to performance and stability",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various bug fixes: Cameras, Menus, Visuals, Collisions…",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Notable fixes in this update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed mini performance freezes on the Tarmac part of New Washington Returns, after descending the stairs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue where the Activation & Deactivation of the Flow Analyzer could stop working after the first use of the item",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue in the Mandragore in which the player could leave the playable area and get stuck in the scenery after using the \"jump\" function in a corner of the hideout",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jungle: Fixed an autosave that could be triggered on the zipline, causing Conrad to fall into the void each time this save was loaded",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix of an issue where the Heavy Mod VFX blasted Conrad instead of the enemies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix of an issue where Conrad could go and fight in an area out of camera range",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The “Deliver packages” mission doesn’t restart anymore when the player reaches Atlantica after finishing it",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix of an issue where the wrong input was displayed in the Missions panel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔫 Play Flashback 2 now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "📬 Stay connected!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twitter - Facebook - Instagram - TikTok - Discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
