    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Players,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've got a new patch available for Flashback 2, here are the details:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "General",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We advise the players to start a new game once the new update is installed if previously blocked by save issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A majority of dysfunctional manual saves have been deactivated.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When Amy needs to follow Conrad, she has a jog animation, and the player doesn't have to stop to wait for her anymore.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All Holocubes can be picked up and are available in the inventory.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Optimization of graphic quality settings has been done.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The player can now observe specific UI in the HUD that indicate when they enter or leave a radioactive zone or a non-weapon zone.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Global topics",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Saving and loading fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Crash fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "UI/UX fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Collision fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enemies and NPCs behavior fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other specific bugs fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Fix of a single out of memory crash encountered at the end of first visual novel.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Mecha Assembly terminal can now be unlocked if a save in Monte Charge is loaded after assembling the Mecha.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Fix of an issue where Conrad could remain stuck when using jump function next to his desk in the GBI Academy",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Proceeding as fast as possible through the analyzer part cannot lead to a blocker anymore.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Loading a Manual save does not create multiple saves in the same location anymore.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Fix of a blocker due to enemies not spawning after loading AutoSave.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Fix of a blocker in the presidents' room when loading save and coming back.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. Fix of a specific issue where the user cannot control Conrad when loading a save.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "9. Fix of a blocker encountered as the Alpha Radiant is unable to walk down the stairs after Conrad is killed and use the Resume functionality.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "10. No more blocker due to invincible enemy if loading an autosave.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "11. Fix of a blocker when loading a Manual save if it was made before delivering the package to Atlantica.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "12. The user will not be spawned out of bounds anymore after deleting a save followed by loading the same one from Pause Menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "13. Fix of a crash encountered when entering Western District after finishing Energy sector.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "14. Player cannot get blocked at second DNA door when skipping previous room in New Tokyo.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "15. Fix of an issue where Conrad loses collision while dying on the jumping ledge inside the factory resulting in getting stuck under the map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "16. Loading any save after losing collisions, leads to black screen while in gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "17. Blocker due to enemies disappearing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "18. Fix of a crash on the Ring when traveling from Atlantica to Pacifica.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "19. Fix of a crash encountered when entering the room with the two presidents.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "20. The user will not encounter a crash anymore while suspending the title when creating a new game during loading screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "21. Fix of a crash while changing the language after suspending the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "22. Fix of a blocker appearing when player loads the autosave at the beginning of Amy Lab rescue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "23. Fix of missing text when earning or spending credits.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "24. Fix of a blocker appearing when loading a save, with the condition that the save is made after activating the node to the elevator but not calling the elevator down. (New Washington)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "25. Holocubes are now rendered after loading any save.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "26. Fix an issue where the user may go out of bounds when jumping above some entrances.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "27. Alpha Radiant now always aim to attack the player.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "28. Fix an issue where player can leave a room, but camera stays stuck when leaving without killing all enemies.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "29. Fix an issue where the user could remain stuck when reaching the departure area in Pacifica.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "30. Player cannot jump onto zipline after dying anymore.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "31. Fix an issue where the game enters a slow mode state in Jungle chapter after opening the pause menu and inventory during loading screen to New Tokyo.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "32. Fix an issue where Conrad falls of the rooftop after the menu got opened and closed during animation.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "33. Fix a FPS drop below 30fps throughout the Jungle chapter when Conrad is continuously shooting his gun.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "34. Fix transparency levels issues present in multiple parts of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "35. Fix of a dialogue displayed twice when Helen is contacted by Professor Lynch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "36. Fix of a missing background music and ambient sound after loading a save created in the Atlantica factory.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "37. Fix of a visual issue where holocubes text gets cut off if player presses Create button while choices of dialogue are present.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "38. Fix of an issue in the Jungle that reset the Audio parameters to 0.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "39. Holocubes texts are now displayed after picking them up.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "40. No more missing pictures in visual novel in Mandragore.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "41. The Spacebar icon is not overlapped anymore when viewing Holocubes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "42. Fix of an issue where a code snippet was displayed on the screen when deleting a save from the save menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "43. Fix an issue where the first cutscene - when starting a new game – does not show any image.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "44. The blur now works in the \"Options\" and \"Inventory\" menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "45. The \"Delete\" button is not usable anymore without existing saved files.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "46. In the Morph Vessel, the door of the middle floor will now open everytime after speaking with professor and killing all enemies at the lab.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "47. Fix of an issue where the application may get hard locked during Lazarus fight.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "N.B. We are currently planning other updates that will bring additional bugfixes and improvements to the Flashback 2 experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
